    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846970/extras/b5835ab7c846de05f7424ef8d2ca2159.poster.avif?t=1709006558\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846970/extras/b5835ab7c846de05f7424ef8d2ca2159.webm?t=1709006558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846970/extras/b5835ab7c846de05f7424ef8d2ca2159.mp4?t=1709006558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Idler Coaster is an incremental idle management game that give you true freedom over your build orders and your strategies.<br><br>Build and upgrades rides, take care of your guests and manage budget sheets like a true capitalist to become the #1 amusement park corporation in the world! <br><br>Do you like clickers games but wish you had more control on what you build?<br><br>In Idler Coaster, every ride is a money generator. You can build the ride you want, where you want!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846970/extras/d63474854b69212b904dbd05c7448d81.poster.avif?t=1709006558\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846970/extras/d63474854b69212b904dbd05c7448d81.webm?t=1709006558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846970/extras/d63474854b69212b904dbd05c7448d81.mp4?t=1709006558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846970/extras/b5835ab7c846de05f7424ef8d2ca2159.poster.avif?t=1709006558\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846970/extras/b5835ab7c846de05f7424ef8d2ca2159.webm?t=1709006558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846970/extras/b5835ab7c846de05f7424ef8d2ca2159.mp4?t=1709006558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Idler Coaster is an incremental idle management game that give you true freedom over your build orders and your strategies.<br><br>Build and upgrades rides, take care of your guests and manage budget sheets like a true capitalist to become the #1 amusement park corporation in the world! <br><br>Do you like clickers games but wish you had more control on what you build?<br><br>In Idler Coaster, every ride is a money generator. You can build the ride you want, where you want!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846970/extras/d63474854b69212b904dbd05c7448d81.poster.avif?t=1709006558\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846970/extras/d63474854b69212b904dbd05c7448d81.webm?t=1709006558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846970/extras/d63474854b69212b904dbd05c7448d81.mp4?t=1709006558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
